id=fiio_m33_audiotrack_noretrack
name=FiiO M33 R2R audio lag fixes
version=v1.3
versionCode=13
author=ryanmagoon
description=Fixes audio running ahead of video and lyrics, and latency building up over time, on the FiiO M33 R2R. Patches copies of the device's own audio libraries at install time. Ships no FiiO binaries.
